        <mxCell id="card_sandbox" parent="lane_infra" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064E3B;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#F8FAFC;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=11;shadow=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#34d399&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot;&gt;E2B Micro-VM Sandbox / Modal Cloud&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#a7f3d0&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;backend/sandbox/e2b_executor.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Isolated hardware virtualization container per run&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Headless Chromium (Playwright):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;  - Mobile Viewport: 375 × 812 (Device scale factor 2.0)&lt;br&gt;  - Desktop Viewport: 1440 × 900 (Desktop reference)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Atomic Patch Application:&lt;/b&gt; Applies diff to tree&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Hot Module Reload (HMR):&lt;/b&gt; Sub-300ms live refresh&lt;br&gt;• Full network &amp; credential isolation from host" vertex="1">
